'''Alienbeam''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was obtainable by unboxing the [[2025 Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2025|2025 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has ended.

== Appearance ==
The weapon has a bright green, cone-shaped energy beam for its blade, shaped like a drill and tapering to a pointed tip. Three smooth green rings wrap around the upper half of the beam. Near the base, the beam has sharp green edges that flare slightly outward. The guard looks like a small metallic UFO with silver plating and a round green center. Attached underneath is a short silver handle with three stacked rings around it, ending in a small pointed green cap that matches the tip of the blade.

== Trivia ==
* It partners with the godly gun [[Raygun]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Alien Set|Alien Set]].
* It has a chroma counterpart called [[Chroma Alienbeam]].

